-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----
<YOUR_CLIENT_PRIVATE_KEY>

This private key is generated during the CloudHSM cluster initialization process.
It is paired with client.crt for mutual TLS authentication to the HSM.

To obtain this file:
  1. Generate a key pair during cluster initialization
  2. The private key is your client.key

IMPORTANT: Never share or commit this file to source control.

File location on Linux server after setup:
  /opt/cloudhsm/etc/client.key
-----END RSA PRIVATE KEY-----